Package: microclimlearn
Type: Package
Title: Tutorial Package for Learning Microclimate Modelling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ilya", "Maclean", email = "i.m.d.maclean@exeter.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lydia", "Soifer", role = "aut"),
    person("David", "Klinges", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Functions and tutorials for learning, exploring, and
    visualising microclimate processes and environmental biophysics. The
    package is intended to support teaching and training in microclimate
    modelling, surface energy balance, and environmental change ecology.
